stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    %% =========================
    %% BROWSE PHASE (SOFT CART + DEMAND SIGNAL)
    %% =========================
    BROWSE: Browsing Catalog
    BROWSE --> ADD_TO_CART: Add item to cart
    ADD_TO_CART --> ADD_TO_CART: Modify quantities
    ADD_TO_CART --> BROWSE: Remove item

    note right of ADD_TO_CART
      • No reservation
      • No stock blocked
      • Unlimited browsing
      • No audit event
      • Demand Signal (soft):
        - Track "interest" (approx) per item
        - TTL window + deduped per user/session
        - Safe display (e.g., "10+ watching")
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% CHECKOUT GATING (SOFT CART ALLOWED EVEN IF UNAVAILABLE)
    %% =========================
    ADD_TO_CART --> CHECKOUT_ATTEMPT: Click Checkout
    CHECKOUT_ATTEMPT --> CHECKOUT_PENDING: All items available-to-sell
    CHECKOUT_ATTEMPT --> WAITING: Some items fully reserved / unavailable

    WAITING: Waiting In Cart (Not Reserved)
    WAITING --> CHECKOUT_ATTEMPT: Retry / auto-refresh availability

    note right of WAITING
      • Cart may include items even if availability is 0
      • Show countdown until next expected release
      • User can keep item in cart (no ownership implied)
      • If reservation releases, user can proceed
      • If another buyer pays, show "Sold out" and block/require removal
      • No inventory mutation
      • Optional AUDIT: checkout_waiting
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% CHECKOUT / RESERVATION (HARD HOLD BEGINS HERE)
    %% =========================
    CHECKOUT_PENDING: Stripe Checkout Session Active
    CHECKOUT_PENDING --> RESERVED: Reservation Created

    note right of RESERVED
      • 10-minute timer
      • Stock treated as decremented
      • Visible to all users
      • Prevents overselling
      • AUDIT: reservation_created
      • Correlation ID = reservation_id
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% RESERVATION OUTCOMES
    %% =========================
    RESERVED --> EXPIRED: Timer expires
    EXPIRED: Reservation Expired
    EXPIRED --> ADD_TO_CART: Stock auto-released

    note right of EXPIRED
      • Stripe session fails
      • Stock restored globally
      • AUDIT: reservation_expired
      • Inventory delta logged (+qty)
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% PAYMENT SUCCESS (AUTHORITATIVE)
    %% =========================
    RESERVED --> PAID: Stripe webhook\ncheckout.session.completed
    PAID: Payment Confirmed (Single Authority)

    note right of PAID
      • Idempotent webhook
      • Stripe event_id recorded
      • Reservation → Order
      • AUDIT: payment_confirmed
      • AUDIT: inventory_decremented
      • Inventory delta logged (-qty)
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% FULFILLMENT
    %% =========================
    PAID --> FULFILLMENT_ASSIGNED: Auto-assign location
    FULFILLMENT_ASSIGNED --> FULFILLMENT_ASSIGNED: Admin override (optional)

    note right of FULFILLMENT_ASSIGNED
      • Location chosen after payment
      • Global stock already reduced
      • Location stock decremented here
      • AUDIT: fulfillment_assigned
      • Location-level delta logged
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% COMPLETION
    %% =========================
    FULFILLMENT_ASSIGNED --> FULFILLED: Item shipped / picked up

    note right of FULFILLED
      • Physical handling complete
      • AUDIT: order_fulfilled
    end note

    FULFILLED --> COMPLETED: Order closed

    note right of COMPLETED
      • Order immutable
      • Inventory settled
      • AUDIT: order_completed
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% REFUNDS / CANCELLATIONS
    %% =========================
    PAID --> REFUNDED: Cancel before fulfillment
    REFUNDED: Payment refunded
    REFUNDED --> BROWSE: Stock returned

    note right of REFUNDED
      • Allowed only pre-fulfillment
      • Stock restored explicitly
      • AUDIT: order_refunded
      • Inventory delta logged (+qty)
    end note

    %% =========================
    %% HARD STOPS (POST-CART, PRE-RESERVATION)
    %% =========================
    CHECKOUT_PENDING --> BLOCKED: Any item unavailable (race / stale cart)
    BLOCKED --> ADD_TO_CART

    note right of BLOCKED
      • Checkout blocked
      • Clear user message
      • Item requires removal OR wait (if temporarily reserved)
      • No inventory mutation
      • Optional AUDIT: checkout_blocked
    end note
